00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.000 line:95%
 La police, 
 les douanes... 

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.840 line:95%
 On a besoin 
 des entreprises. 

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.480 line:95%
<c.cyan> -L'un des objectifs, 
 c'est de les encourager </c>

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:28.560 line:95%
