00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.680 line:95%
<c.cyan> dans l'Essonne. </c>

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.560 size:51% position:26% line:94%
 -Bonjour, Auriane ! 
 
 -Bonjour ! 

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:47.160 size:66% position:33% line:94%
 -Enchantée.
 
 -Marc Truchot, directeur. 

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.400 line:95%
 Bienvenue ! 

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.560 line:95%
 -Auriane Mallo, 30 ans. 

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.200 line:95%
 Equipe de France d'épée. 

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.080 line:95%
 Quadruple 
 championne d'Europe 

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.000 line:95%
 par équipe. 

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.560 line:95%
 3e aux championnats d'Europe 
 en individuel. 

